    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξιό-πιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trustworthy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.123b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἄν εἰκότως φαίνοιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτησίας οὐκ ὢν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					606a8
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.5.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναύλοχα ἀ. πρὸς τοσαύτην ναυτιλίαν</span>”
				<i>sufficient for . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.77
			</span></i> K. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			evidence, <i>trustworthy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				741a37
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἀ. συνῶπται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					741a34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in bad sense,
				<i>plausible,</i> in Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timae.
					70
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).139
			</span></i>.</div>
